      },
      "answer": "4",
      "acceptable": [],
      "check": "7 - 3",
      "hints": [
        "Subtract: 3 − 7 = −4, so x³ / x⁷ = x⁻⁴.",
        "A negative exponent means one over: x⁻⁴ = 1/x⁴.",
        "Or cancel: 3 x's cancel, 4 are left on the bottom."
      ],
      "solution": "x³⁻⁷ = x⁻⁴ = 1/x⁴, so n = <b>4</b>"
